WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.962
Step 1. Open the policy.

1.2
00:00:01.962 --> 00:00:07.454
In Immunization policies, type a part of its name in Search policies by name,

1.3
00:00:07.454 --> 00:00:12.947
then select the name. Care opens the policy page with its scope badge.

2.1
00:00:12.947 --> 00:00:15.045
Step 2. Change the policy.

2.2
00:00:15.045 --> 00:00:19.951
The page has the same fields and outline as when you create a policy.

2.3
00:00:19.951 --> 00:00:25.426
Here you change the description and add an Overdue offset; Care shows Unsaved

2.4
00:00:25.426 --> 00:00:26.495
changes.

3.1
00:00:26.495 --> 00:00:30.008
Step 3. Save the changes. Select Save policy.

3.2
00:00:30.008 --> 00:00:32.837
Care shows Immunization policy updated.

3.3
00:00:32.837 --> 00:00:38.856
The change applies the next time a user applies the policy; schedules that patients

3.4
00:00:38.856 --> 00:00:41.314
already have do not change.
